  id: interchange
  title: 9. Thirty Lanes to Nowhere
  region: Sunsprawl Stack Interchange
  briefing: Protect a mobile evidence server across the unfinished interchange. Sunsprawl
    is deploying trucks from both shoulders. The server must reach all three transfer
    points.
  opening: 'Mara: The interchange has thirty lanes and no exit to the hospital. Their
    planning document calls this a retention strategy.'
  midpoint: 'Silt: I brought spare network cable. Mara: How much? Silt: Enough to
    make the freeway someone''s problem.'
  closing: 'Mara: The server is safe. We left the median in better condition than
    procurement did, which is not a high bar.'
  optionalObjective: Build an 8-hit destruction combo
